flowchart TB
    C["Continuing Chief Codex thread<br/>Instructions + conversation or compaction + tool results<br/>Codex manages the model context window"]
    I["Private instructions and owner registry<br/>AGENTS.md · priorities.md · projects.md"]
    B["Task facts: Markdown cards<br/>Folder = status · timestamped movement history"]
    L["Transport facts: private SQLite<br/>Requests · attribution · dispatch · routes · delivery receipts"]
    O["Existing owner thread<br/>Separate model context and project repository evidence"]
    M["Optional Codex memory hints<br/>Verify changing facts; not new authority"]
    G["Private Git recovery<br/>Instructions/cards/reports + scoped sanitized human-text exports"]
    I -->|supplied or selectively read| C
    B -->|read current task| C
    C -->|record outcome / move same card| B
    L -->|reconcile pending / uncertain action| C
    C -->|one relevant brief| O
    O -->|outcome or necessary missing input| C
    M -.->|only relevant hints| C
    I --> G
    B --> G
    O -->|link compact evidence| G
    G -.->|recovery only, not routine context injection| C
    X["Not covered by Git:<br/>live databases · credentials · browser sessions · media"]
    G --- X
